{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 62,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.21018981933594,
        511.11737060546875,
        83.29818725585938
      ],
      "text": "Are there implications for user preferences and values, acceptability, feasibility,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        83.61033630371094,
        481.1258239746094,
        97.69833374023438
      ],
      "text": "patient equity and human rights from the implementation of LC-mNAATs?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.36524200439453,
        526.874755859375,
        121.51023864746094
      ],
      "text": "The findings from the studies that focused on LC-aNAATs are largely applicable to LC-mNAATs,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977176666259766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        123.86524200439453,
        524.3816528320312,
        137.01023864746094
      ],
      "text": "with the caveat of slightly lower sensitivity and the lack of ability to detect resistance to rifampicin.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        147.86907958984375,
        527.3134155273438,
        161.0140838623047
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review of the qualitative evidence of LC-NAATs (Web Annex B.10) did not identify",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98138427734375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.36907958984375,
        526.6284790039062,
        176.5140838623047
      ],
      "text": "any studies focused on LC-mNAATs (acknowledging that a few studies did not specify the type",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98674201965332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        178.86907958984375,
        230.05580139160156,
        192.0140838623047
      ],
      "text": "of NAAT they were focusing on).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.37298583984375,
        496.3900451660156,
        214.5179901123047
      ],
      "text": "However, selected findings from the interview study, did focus specifically on TB-LAMP:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.125,
        78.81909942626953,
        234.27000427246094
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        221.125,
        526.9751586914062,
        234.27000427246094
      ],
      "text": "In 2018, Nigeria adopted the use of TB LAMP (along with GeneXpert and Truenat). At the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        236.625,
        526.953369140625,
        249.77000427246094
      ],
      "text": "time of the interview, there were 199 TB LAMP machines in Nigeria. These are placed both",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        252.125,
        526.9642333984375,
        265.27001953125
      ],
      "text": "in sites where GeneXpert is available, to decrease workload, and in peripheral laboratories",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        267.625,
        526.699462890625,
        280.77001953125
      ],
      "text": "where the infrastructure is insufficient to accommodate GeneXpert. Positive results from TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.986641883850098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        283.125,
        475.15869140625,
        296.27001953125
      ],
      "text": "LAMP are sent to the nearest site with a GeneXpert or Truenat machine for DST.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.625,
        78.81909942626953,
        311.77001953125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        298.625,
        526.953125,
        311.77001953125
      ],
      "text": "The Philippines National TB Programme (NTP) guidelines advise the use of TB LAMP as an",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        314.125,
        526.6795654296875,
        327.27001953125
      ],
      "text": "alternative primary diagnostic test in settings where access to GeneXpert is limited and that",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98634147644043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        329.625,
        527.0789794921875,
        342.77001953125
      ],
      "text": "currently rely on sputum transport riders (STRiders). TB LAMP was piloted in 2019 (April",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        345.125,
        526.9532470703125,
        358.27001953125
      ],
      "text": "to September) and 2020 (October to February 2021) in a rural health unit, polyclinic and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        360.625,
        526.9310913085938,
        373.77001953125
      ],
      "text": "private hospital, and for TB mass screening in a rural health unit. The pilot implementation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        376.125,
        526.9642944335938,
        389.27001953125
      ],
      "text": "only tested sputum with TB LAMP and did not test for TB in MDR risk groups, children or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        391.625,
        526.9310913085938,
        404.77001953125
      ],
      "text": "people living with HIV. According to a laboratory manager, there are about six or seven TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        407.125,
        526.9200439453125,
        420.27001953125
      ],
      "text": "LAMP machines in the Philippines. These are not currently in use but could be if there was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        422.625,
        225.10089111328125,
        435.77001953125
      ],
      "text": "support for buying reagents.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.963623046875,
        526.9666137695312,
        461.108642578125
      ],
      "text": "According to Nigeria’s TB LAMP guidelines, the following criteria should be used to prioritize",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.963623046875,
        194.53750610351562,
        475.108642578125
      ],
      "text": "sites for TB LAMP testing:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.7156066894531,
        78.81909942626953,
        494.8606262207031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        481.7156066894531,
        226.53028869628906,
        494.8606262207031
      ],
      "text": "facilities with high workload;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.2156066894531,
        78.81909942626953,
        510.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        497.2156066894531,
        359.6934814453125,
        510.3606262207031
      ],
      "text": "facilities with or without an existing molecular platform;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        512.715576171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        525.860595703125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        512.715576171875,
        342.8322448730469,
        525.860595703125
      ],
      "text": "laboratories with adequate space and infrastructure;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.215576171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        541.360595703125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        528.215576171875,
        345.13037109375,
        541.360595703125
      ],
      "text": "availability of qualified medical laboratory personnel;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.715576171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        556.860595703125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        543.715576171875,
        372.5572204589844,
        556.860595703125
      ],
      "text": "an adequate number of medical laboratory personnel; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.215576171875,
        78.81909942626953,
        572.360595703125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        559.215576171875,
        453.5001220703125,
        572.360595703125
      ],
      "text": "a storage facility (e.g. refrigerator) for laboratory and administrative supply.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.037841796875,
        226.36456298828125,
        601.1257934570312
      ],
      "text": "User preferences and values",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.292724609375,
        527.1355590820312,
        623.437744140625
      ],
      "text": "An interview study on TB LAMP involving sites in Nigeria and the Philippines found the following",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        624.292724609375,
        339.87860107421875,
        637.437744140625
      ],
      "text": "views of laboratory personnel and programme officers:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.044677734375,
        78.81909942626953,
        657.189697265625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        644.044677734375,
        526.6234130859375,
        657.189697265625
      ],
      "text": "TB LAMP is making laboratory work easier over time through familiarity and because it",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        659.544677734375,
        192.86029052734375,
        672.689697265625
      ],
      "text": "clears the workbench;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.044677734375,
        78.81909942626953,
        688.189697265625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        675.044677734375,
        318.536376953125,
        688.189697265625
      ],
      "text": "compared to SSM, TB LAMP is easier to use; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.544677734375,
        78.81909942626953,
        703.689697265625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        690.544677734375,
        526.9202270507812,
        703.689697265625
      ],
      "text": "in direct comparison with Xpert Ultra, TB LAMP is more hands-on and requires more user",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        706.044677734375,
        357.593994140625,
        719.189697265625
      ],
      "text": "steps and time for preparing and processing specimens.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "46 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}